From: Matt Graham <matt.sg@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:25:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] templates: generic runtime types, thin starter

recomp_types.h keeps the thunk register restore (RECOMP_ICALL_INVOKE) and
opt-in guest memcpy; the starter dispatches through src/host.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
